# RVHyno monitor

This projects implements a monitor for the formula
```
{{formula}}
```

If you used the default options, the project is already configures and build, and it should contain the binary `monitor`.
You can run this binary as:
```
./monitor trace1.csv trace2.csv trace3.csv ...
```

Where `trace*.csv` are CSV files containing traces in the following format:
{ for cg.args.data }

## Re-building

```
cmake --build .
```

